cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Unpublished 1.5.0rc1 software candidate: cite its exact Git commit, not an earlier version-specific DOI. Cite the separate 1.3 preprint for historical research."
title: "EACP Operational-Provenance Artifact: Bounded Operability Candidate"
abstract: >-
  Version 1.5.0rc1 operability candidate, preserving Profile 1.3
  semantics and historical experimental evidence. Adds an installed query path,
  checkpoint-bound offline query verification, atomic cursor pages, diagnostics,
  consistent physical backup and current-anchor recovery. The retained 1.4
  live attestation does not attest this new implementation. Tests are author-executed; independent
  reproduction, organizational pilots and production validation are not claimed.
  The archived software DOI in references identifies the artifact, not the accompanying
  article. Licensing is file-scoped; see LICENSES/README.md and paper/README.md.
